# A steel filing cabinet, three drawers. Against a side wall it shows its
# side (frame side, drawers facing right, mirrored on the east wall).
sprite filing-cabinet
size 16 32
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 16
tag cabinet storage clear-1

frame default
